<title>VENEZUELA: SOCCER-VENEZUELA AND ECUADOR DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VENEZUELA AND ECUADOR DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MARACAIBO, Venezuela 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela and</p>
<p>Ecuador drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup</p>
<p>qualifier Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Venezuela - Gabriel Miranda (82)</p>
<p>Ecuador - Ivan Hurtado (55)</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
</text>
